        "content": "<p>avanhatt opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14701\">PR #14701</a> from <code>avanhatt:i32x2-aarch64</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>More verifier-found cases where rules are not correct guarded to apply to scalar types instead of 64-bit vector types, this time in <code>aarch64</code>.</p>\n<p>This PR adds <code>ty_int</code> guards as well as some rules to lower 64-bit vector types that were otherwise missing, plus a filets.</p>\n<p>Related to #14631, #14566. </p>\n</blockquote>",
